1
00:06:25,714 --> 00:06:31,714
The Christmas Checklist is a tv movie, comedy,
romance film directed by Anne De Léan.

2
00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
A grieving daughter discovers a red envelope from her mom that contains a final request: for her to complete
a Christmas Checklist of twelve activities before Christmas, the last one being “Find Love”.

3
00:19:17,142 --> 00:19:23,142
Emily Robertson, played by Sarah Power.

4
00:25:42,857 --> 00:25:48,857
Noah Carver, played by Jarod Joseph.

5
00:32:08,571 --> 00:32:14,571
Knox Catalina 'Kat', played by Monica Rodriguez.

6
00:38:34,285 --> 00:38:40,285
Isaiah, played by Dakota Jamal Wellman.

7
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Nick, played by Alain Goulem.

8
00:51:25,714 --> 00:51:31,714
Mary Masters, played by Laura Mitchell.

9
00:57:51,428 --> 00:57:57,428
The Adventure of the Christmas Pudding and a Selection of Entrées is a short story collection written by
Agatha Christie and first published in the UK by the Collins Crime Club on 24 October 1960.

10
01:04:17,142 --> 01:04:23,142
It is the only Christie first edition published in the UK that contains stories with both
Hercule Poirot and Miss Marple, the writer's two most famous detectives.

11
01:10:42,857 --> 01:10:48,857
It retailed in the UK for twelve shillings and
sixpence (12/6) and comprises six cases.

12
01:17:08,571 --> 01:17:14,571
It was not published in the US although the stories it
contains were published in other volumes there.

13
01:23:34,285 --> 01:23:40,285
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
